%% Architecture source derived from pipeline/graph.py and the implemented agents.
%% Security controls are shown only at their verified enforcement locations.
flowchart LR
    U[User task / CLI input] --> P0[run_pipeline]
    C[Config selection<br/>config_a / config_b / config_c] --> L[load_security_config]
    L --> A{Authentication gate<br/>Config B/C only}
    P0 --> A
    A -->|accepted or Config A| G[LangGraph compiled state graph]
    A -->|rejected| R0[Return error state<br/>no agent execution]

    subgraph LG[LangGraph execution sequence]
        direction LR
        P[Planner Agent<br/>ChatGroq plan generation] --> R[Research Agent]
        R --> E[Execution Agent<br/>ChatGroq synthesis]
        E --> V[Evaluation Agent<br/>ChatGroq quality score]
    end
    G --> P
    V --> O[Output / final state returned to caller]

    IV[Config C input validation<br/>keyword + length] -.-> P
    SC[Config B/C tool permission scoping<br/>before MCP invocation] -.-> R
    TB[Config C max 3 MCP calls per run<br/>deny fourth attempt] -.-> R
    OL[Config B/C output length validation<br/>after MCP response] -.-> R
    OS[Config C configured content scan] -.-> E

    R -->|tool request| MC[MCP client<br/>MCP Python SDK<br/>stdio transport]
    MC -->|read_file request| FS[File-read MCP server<br/>read_file]
    FS -->|tool response| MC
    MC -->|web_search request| WS[Mock web-search MCP server<br/>web_search]
    WS -->|tool response| MC
    MC -->|selected result| R
    FS --> D[(data/ files)]
    WS --> MR[(predefined mock results)]

    O --> M[MetricsCollector]
    M --> CSV[(results/raw_results.csv<br/>20-column metrics log)]
    P0 -.-> LC[Configurable logging<br/>INFO / DEBUG]
    G -.-> LC
    P -.-> LC
    R -.-> LC
    E -.-> LC
    V -.-> LC
